  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effectiveness in Public Administration Support Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Efectividad de la Gestin Pblica II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa tiene por objetivo general apoyar acciones de poltica para mejorar la gestin presupuestaria y el control del gasto pblico del Estado Plurinacional de Bolivia, tanto a nivel central como subnacional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support policy measures to improve budget management and the control of public expenditure by the Plurinational State of Bolivia, at both the central and the subnational levels.</narrative>
  </description>
